#: ../../source/docs/finding-the-particular-commit-which-introduced-a-bug.rst:5
#: f5edcae24cac4e3b89e2f7253b1a53a0
msgid "Finding the Particular Commit which Introduced a Bug"
msgstr "查找引入缺陷的特定提交"

#: ../../source/docs/finding-the-particular-commit-which-introduced-a-bug.rst:7
#: 4d29a3f4461c469a8448b0d6bc9775cf
msgid ""
"This article explains how to perform a firmware binary `bisection search "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bisection_method>`__. This is an efficient "
"technique to find the particular build/commit that introduced a reproducible"
" bug."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何对固件二进制文件执行「二分查找法 "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bisection_method>」__。这是一种高效技术，用于找出引入可复现缺陷的特定构建/提交。"

#: ../../source/docs/finding-the-particular-commit-which-introduced-a-bug.rst:13
#: 60b475b6ed5e4e80b03ef20e1db493f6
msgid ""
"Knowing the build in which a defect was first introduced can help identify "
"possible causes of the problem, and inform analysis of logs and other debug "
"techniques."
msgstr "了解缺陷首次引入的构建版本有助于识别问题的可能原因，并为日志分析及其他调试技术提供参考。"

#: ../../source/docs/finding-the-particular-commit-which-introduced-a-bug.rst:17
#: 71ecdefa4123471cb9586d0df27c659a
msgid ""
"Firmware builds are available from `firmware.ardupilot.org "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/>`__ for each vehicle-type: \\ `Copter "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Copter/>`__, `Plane "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Plane/>`__, `Rover "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Rover>`__, `AntennaTracker "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/AntennaTracker/>`__. To perform a bisection "
"search:"
msgstr ""
"各机型的固件构建可从 `firmware.ardupilot.org <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/>`__ "
"获取：`Copter <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Copter/>`__、`Plane "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Plane/>`__、`Rover "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Rover>`__、`AntennaTracker "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/AntennaTracker/>`__。执行二分查找的步骤："

#: ../../source/docs/finding-the-particular-commit-which-introduced-a-bug.rst:25
#: 6ac5d74a41584c96ace9863bc6d0391f
msgid ""
"First test the firmware build half-way between the known working and failing"
" builds. The result gives you a new \"known working\" or \"known failing\" "
"build and halves the number of builds that must be tested."
msgstr "首先测试已知正常构建与已知故障构建之间的中间固件构建。结果将给出一个新的「已知正常」或「已知故障」构建，并将需要测试的构建数量减半。"

#: ../../source/docs/finding-the-particular-commit-which-introduced-a-bug.rst:28
#: 3211062b3fcc4835b20283aae27cf1f1
msgid ""
"Repeat this test process, each time halving the size of the test range, "
"until the problem build has been identified."
msgstr "重复此测试过程，每次将测试范围缩小一半，直至识别出问题构建。"

#: ../../source/docs/finding-the-particular-commit-which-introduced-a-bug.rst:31
#: aa1a9270bb8145c681fc862c2f8e1f9c
msgid ""
"Once you have identified the problem issue, note the build number and "
"include this in your bug report."
msgstr "一旦识别出问题所在，记录构建编号并将其包含在缺陷报告中。"

#: ../../source/docs/finding-the-particular-commit-which-introduced-a-bug.rst:36
#: 061ec13a241648a08e8d3a3df1196b34
msgid ""
"The autotest system generates a new firmware build for every commit to the "
"source tree (this is a slight simplification, as commits may be batched if "
"they arrive while a previous build is being tested). This means that if an "
"error is reproducible it is possible to identify the specific commit(s) in "
"which it first occurs."
msgstr ""
"自动化测试系统为源代码树的每个提交生成一个新的固件构建（这是轻微简化，实际上如果提交在前一个构建测试期间到达，可能会被批量处理）。这意味着如果错误可复现，就有可能识别出它首次出现的特定提交。"

#: ../../source/docs/finding-the-particular-commit-which-introduced-a-bug.rst:41
#: ed26a0c494e64bba8764f475355ed15c
msgid ""
"Given the number of ArduPilot firmware builds it should be possible to "
"locate the problem build/commit within around 10 tests (at time of writing)."
msgstr "考虑到 ArduPilot 固件构建的数量，应该可以在大约 10 次测试内（撰写本文时）定位问题构建/提交。"
